{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24352","headline":"初冬月夜得皇甫泽州手札幷诗数篇因遣报书偶题长句 · 白居易","name":"初冬月夜得皇甫泽州手札幷诗数篇因遣报书偶题长句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清泠玉韵两三章，落箔银钩七八行。\n心逐报书悬雁足，梦寻来路绕羊肠。\n水南地空多明月，山北天寒足早霜。\n最恨泼醅新熟酒，迎冬不得共君尝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24352.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24352","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}